Dear Markus:
	I know that "shutdown -h now" or "halt" can power off well.
S5 will be power off well in Windows XP. Can Linux do, too?
Allen

-----Original Message----
From: Markus Gaugusch [mailto:markus-z+rTbpWsRgbk7+2FdBfRIA@public.gmane.org]
